    "shortDescription": "Build Yeeflow apps with AI",
    "longDescription": "Build and maintain Yeeflow business applications in Codex using guided skills and an OAuth-backed hosted MCP server. The plugin helps you plan application architecture; discover authorized workspaces and applications; generate, inspect, and validate Yeeflow packages, forms, workflows, dashboards, data lists, portals, custom services, AI agents, and copilots; and manage supported App Builder resources. Read operations can inspect Yeeflow data you are authorized to access. Create, update, delete, signing, import, install, and upgrade actions require appropriate permissions and explicit confirmation. Validation or API acceptance does not by itself prove Designer rendering or production runtime behavior.",
